		{
			title: "Don't Forget to Breathe"
			icon: "creatingspace:basic_spacesuit_helmet"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 1.0d
			description: [
				"Vacuum is not forgiving. Weave Basic Spacesuit Fabric and assemble the helmet, leggings, and boots."
				"Note: there is no suit chestplate -- the chest slot is an oxygen backtank (next quest). Fabric feeds every suit piece, so batch it."
