		{
			title: "A Breath of Air"
			icon: "creatingspace:copper_oxygen_backtank"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 2.0d
			description: [
				"The Copper Oxygen Backtank is your chest slot and your air supply. The Oxygen Sealer pressurizes a room so you can work without the suit indoors."
				"Together these are your first real life-support loop -- refill the tank before you leave sealed air."
