			x: 1.0d
			y: 3.0d
			description: [
				"Engines are built up from tiered structural parts. Andesite walls and pipes are the entry tier; copper is a step up in heat tolerance."
				"Higher tiers (inconel, hastelloy) exist for extreme engines -- you won't need them to reach orbit, but the crafting pattern is identical."
